1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,349
Every stream has its own language.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,110
Meet Emote Exchange.

3
00:00:04,223 --> 00:00:08,069
A live emote market where your
community's attention moves the Prices.

4
00:00:08,286 --> 00:00:11,273
Coins are free play points,
with no cash value.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,546
Buy into the moment.

6
00:00:12,659 --> 00:00:15,274
Type buy, an emote name, and a quantity.

7
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:17,449
Sell some shares, or sell them all.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,559
Check in with greetings and a few words.

9
00:00:19,776 --> 00:00:22,763
Claim once per Stream:
fifty Coins to start.

10
00:00:22,867 --> 00:00:27,503
Five hundred Coins, delivered straight
to the Trader, with a reply in chat.

11
00:00:27,567 --> 00:00:28,917
Emote Exchange.

12
00:00:29,064 --> 00:00:30,508
Chat is the market.
